        "worked_solution": "To compute\n\n$$\n\\frac{8n}{2n-6}\u00f7\\frac{4n}{10n-30},\n$$\n\nwe just need to multiply by the reciprocal of the divisor:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{8n}{2n-6}\u00f7\\frac{4n}{10n-30} & = \\\\ \\frac{8n}{2n-6}\\cdot \\frac{10n-30}{4n} & = \\\\ \\frac{4n\\cdot 2}{2n-6}\\cdot \\frac{5(2n-6)}{4n} & = \\\\ \\frac{\\cancel{4n}\\cdot 2}{\\cancel{2n-6}}\\cdot \\frac{5\\cancel{(2n-6)}}{\\cancel{4n}} & = \\\\ 2\\cdot 5 & = \\\\ 10\\end{aligned}\n$$",
